NOT an HTTP endpoint — use a WebSocket client.

Connection URL:
  ws://localhost:8000/ws/notifications/?token={{accessToken}}

Events received:
  Match found:       { type: 'match',        item_id, item_type, match_count }
  Claim updated:     { type: 'claim_status', claim_id, status }
  New claim (staff): { type: 'new_claim',    claim_id, venue_id }

Close code 4001 = invalid token (no auto-reconnect).

