Connection URL:
  ws://localhost:8000/ws/chat/{{roomId}}/?token={{accessToken}}

Get roomId first via 'Get / Create Chat Room'.

Send message:
  { "type": "chat_message", "text": "Hello!" }

Events received:
  New message: { type: 'chat_message', room_id, claim_id, sender_id, sender_name, text, created_at }
  Presence:    { type: 'presence', user_id, online }

Close code 4001 = invalid token (no auto-reconnect).
